
# machine translated (Indonesian), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Settings' words for a port: it did not start, Trindle switched it off and on once, and a device came up. $port is the port's name.
usbretry-worked = Port USB { $port } tidak mulai, jadi Trindle mematikan dan menyalakannya sekali. Perangkat berhasil muncul.

# Settings' words for a port: it did not start, Trindle restarted the USB controller, and a device came up. $port is the port's name.
usbretry-worked-controller = Port USB { $port } tidak mulai, jadi Trindle memulai ulang pengendali USB-nya. Perangkat berhasil muncul.

# Settings' words for a port: it did not start, the USB controller was restarted, and nothing came up. $port is the port's name.
usbretry-nothing-controller = Port USB { $port } tidak mulai. Trindle memulai ulang pengendali USB-nya, tetapi tidak ada perangkat yang muncul. Matikan lalu nyalakan komputer untuk memulihkannya.

# Settings' words for a port: nothing came back after it was switched off and on, and the controller was not restarted. $port is the port's name.
usbretry-nothing = Port USB { $port } tidak kembali setelah dimulai ulang. Matikan lalu nyalakan komputer untuk memulihkannya.

